<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">escapism</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Depression is something that sadly, many people have to face. In this story, Catra is a victim who suffers by the hands of depression. To escape from the cruel reality that the universe has set for her, she uses her passion for art and music to escape. Though, it may sound ridiculous, to Catra, the only reason she is still existing on this planet is the fact that she can draw and play music freely. However, when a friendly blonde girl comes along, maybe thereâ€™s another thing to add to her list to stay? Just another Catradora modern / college au TW: talks about depression&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>applesauce6</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
